==Description==
The '''Hex Minion''' was the first enemy to appear in [[The Nightmare Realm]] and [[Containment]] as part of the [[Hexscape Event]] alongside the [[Hex Spawn]]. It had a decent amount of health, higher than the [[Hex Spawn]], while also being quite fast. On some waves, it could spawn with [[Bloated]], [[Nimble]] and [[Aggro]] attributes.

==Appearance==
The '''Hex Minion''' had light maroon skin. It had a circular hole in its torso, revealing that its insides were made out of lava. This lava was also leaking in multiple spots. On its shoulders, it had grey and purple shoulder-pads.

==Strategy==
*Strong early-game towers like the [[Golden Crook Boss]], [[Militant]], [[Cowboy]] and [[Golden Soldier]] can be used to kill this quickly.
*The [[Pyromancer]] and [[Golden Pyromancer]] can be useful here, as it can kill multiple of them with its flames.
*As it is quite fast, stalling towers like the [[Electroshocker]], [[Cryomancer]] or [[Toxic Gunner]] could be used, though due to its low health this is not necessary.

